From: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: oxnas: adapt restored drivers to Linux 6.18 APIs

Update the retained OXNAS drivers for current kernel interfaces.

Signed-off-by: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>

